[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "text": "Hello and welcome to Real Easy English,",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 3.532,
    "zh": "你好，欢迎收听《简易英语》",
    "zh_hant": "你好，歡迎收聽《簡易英語》"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "the podcast where we have real conversations.",
    "start": 3.472,
    "end": 7.013,
    "zh": "在这个播客里，我们会进行真实的对话",
    "zh_hant": "在這個播客裡，我們會進行真實的對話"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "in easy English to help you learn.",
    "start": 6.693,
    "end": 9.214,
    "zh": "用简单的英语帮助你学习。",
    "zh_hant": "用簡單的英語幫助你學習。"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "I'm Beth.",
    "start": 9.415,
    "end": 10.375,
    "zh": "我是贝丝。",
    "zh_hant": "我是貝絲。"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "And I'm Neil.",
    "start": 10.155,
    "end": 11.376,
    "zh": "我是尼尔。",
    "zh_hant": "我是尼爾。"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "There is a video version of this podcast on our website,",
    "start": 11.216,
    "end": 15.438,
    "zh": "这个播客在我们的网站上有视频版本，",
    "zh_hant": "這個播客在我們的網站上有影片版本，"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "where you can also find a worksheet and transcript to help you learn.",
    "start": 15.438,
    "end": 19.66,
    "zh": "在那里你还可以找到工作表和学习用的文本记录。",
    "zh_hant": "在那裡你還可以找到工作表和學習用的文字記錄。"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "It's at bbclearningenglish.com.",
    "start": 19.88,
    "end": 22.421,
    "zh": "网址是bbclearningenglish.com。",
    "zh_hant": "網址是bbclearningenglish.com。"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "Hi, Neil, how are you?",
    "start": 29.245,
    "end": 30.865,
    "zh": "嗨，尼尔，你好吗？",
    "zh_hant": "嗨，尼爾，你好嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "I'm hungry.",
    "start": 30.906,
    "end": 31.986,
    "zh": "我饿了。",
    "zh_hant": "我餓了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "Me too.",
    "start": 31.886,
    "end": 33.066,
    "zh": "我也是。",
    "zh_hant": "我也是。"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "I'm starving.",
    "start": 33.467,
    "end": 35.207,
    "zh": "我快饿死了。",
    "zh_hant": "我快餓死了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "Well, that's good, because we're talking",
    "start": 35.488,
    "end": 38.049,
    "zh": "那挺好的，因为今天我们要聊",
    "zh_hant": "那挺好的，因為今天我們要聊"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "about lunch today.",
    "start": 37.949,
    "end": 39.99,
    "zh": "午餐的话题。",
    "zh_hant": "午餐的話題。"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "We're recording this just before lunch,",
    "start": 40.291,
    "end": 43.032,
    "zh": "我们是在午饭前录这期节目，",
    "zh_hant": "我們是在午飯前錄這期節目，"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "so it's no wonder that we're both very hungry.",
    "start": 42.682,
    "end": 46.353,
    "zh": "所以难怪我们俩都很饿。",
    "zh_hant": "所以難怪我們倆都很餓。"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "text": "You might be able to hear our tummies rumble",
    "start": 46.373,
    "end": 49.555,
    "zh": "你也许能听到我们肚子咕咕叫",
    "zh_hant": "你也許能聽到我們肚子咕咕叫"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "text": "because we're hungry.",
    "start": 49.875,
    "end": 51.216,
    "zh": "因为我们饿了。",
    "zh_hant": "因為我們餓了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "text": "OK.",
    "start": 52.416,
    "end": 53.057,
    "zh": "好。",
    "zh_hant": "好。"
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "text": "So, shall we begin?",
    "start": 52.917,
    "end": 54.517,
    "zh": "那我们开始吧？",
    "zh_hant": "那我們開始吧？"
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "text": "Yes.",
    "start": 54.357,
    "end": 55.098,
    "zh": "好。",
    "zh_hant": "好。"
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "text": "Let's do it.",
    "start": 54.748,
    "end": 55.678,
    "zh": "开始吧。",
    "zh_hant": "開始吧。"
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "text": "What have you got for lunch today?",
    "start": 55.618,
    "end": 58.859,
    "zh": "你今天午餐吃什么？",
    "zh_hant": "你今天午餐吃什麼？"
  },
  {
    "index": 23,
    "text": "for my lunch,",
    "start": 58.659,
    "end": 59.92,
    "zh": "我的午餐",
    "zh_hant": "我的午餐"
  },
  {
    "index": 24,
    "text": "I have chicken with potatoes",
    "start": 60.08,
    "end": 64.222,
    "zh": "有鸡肉配土豆",
    "zh_hant": "有雞肉配土豆"
  },
  {
    "index": 25,
    "text": "and vegetables in a harissa paste.",
    "start": 64.722,
    "end": 68.084,
    "zh": "还有哈里萨酱蔬菜。",
    "zh_hant": "還有哈里薩醬蔬菜。"
  },
  {
    "index": 26,
    "text": "Oh, that sounds really nice.",
    "start": 68.264,
    "end": 70.945,
    "zh": "哦，听起来很不错。",
    "zh_hant": "哦，聽起來很不錯。"
  },
  {
    "index": 27,
    "text": "Yeah, it's leftovers actually,",
    "start": 70.745,
    "end": 73.066,
    "zh": "是啊，其实是剩菜，",
    "zh_hant": "是啊，其實是剩菜，"
  },
  {
    "index": 28,
    "text": "which I have heated up and brought",
    "start": 72.886,
    "end": 75.708,
    "zh": "我热了一下带",
    "zh_hant": "我熱了一下帶"
  },
  {
    "index": 29,
    "text": "in in a little flask.",
    "start": 75.358,
    "end": 77.629,
    "zh": "在小保温瓶里带来了。",
    "zh_hant": "在小保溫瓶裡帶來了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 30,
    "text": "What are leftovers ?",
    "start": 77.409,
    "end": 78.63,
    "zh": "什么是剩菜？",
    "zh_hant": "什麼是剩菜？"
  },
  {
    "index": 31,
    "text": "Good question.",
    "start": 79.29,
    "end": 80.24,
    "zh": "问得好。",
    "zh_hant": "問得好。"
  },
  {
    "index": 32,
    "text": ".",
    "start": 79.84,
    "end": 80.861,
    "zh": "。",
    "zh_hant": "。"
  },
  {
    "index": 33,
    "text": "That's food from a meal",
    "start": 80.461,
    "end": 83.152,
    "zh": "就是一顿饭里",
    "zh_hant": "就是一頓飯裡"
  },
  {
    "index": 34,
    "text": "that you've already had that you didn't finish,",
    "start": 82.802,
    "end": 85.613,
    "zh": "你没吃完剩下的食物，",
    "zh_hant": "你沒吃完剩下的食物，"
  },
  {
    "index": 35,
    "text": "and you can heat it up and eat it again.",
    "start": 85.513,
    "end": 88.314,
    "zh": "你可以热一热再吃。",
    "zh_hant": "你可以熱一熱再吃。"
  },
  {
    "index": 36,
    "text": "Yes.",
    "start": 88.334,
    "end": 89.075,
    "zh": "对。",
    "zh_hant": "對。"
  },
  {
    "index": 37,
    "text": "I also have leftovers for my lunch today.",
    "start": 89.275,
    "end": 92.756,
    "zh": "我今天午餐也带的是剩菜。",
    "zh_hant": "我今天午餐也帶的是剩菜。"
  },
  {
    "index": 38,
    "text": "So, yesterday I",
    "start": 92.436,
    "end": 95.198,
    "zh": "所以，昨天我",
    "zh_hant": "所以，昨天我"
  },
  {
    "index": 39,
    "text": "made a pasta",
    "start": 95.218,
    "end": 96.978,
    "zh": "做了一份意面",
    "zh_hant": "做了一份意麵"
  },
  {
    "index": 40,
    "text": "for lunch with vegetables in it",
    "start": 97.179,
    "end": 101.181,
    "zh": "做午餐，里面有蔬菜，",
    "zh_hant": "做午餐，裡面有蔬菜，"
  },
  {
    "index": 41,
    "text": "and I have that.",
    "start": 102.121,
    "end": 103.342,
    "zh": "我今天就吃这个。",
    "zh_hant": "我今天就吃這個。"
  },
  {
    "index": 42,
    "text": "So, Beth, what do you usually have for lunch?",
    "start": 103.262,
    "end": 106.703,
    "zh": "贝丝，你平时午餐通常吃什么？",
    "zh_hant": "貝絲，你平時午餐通常吃什麼？"
  },
  {
    "index": 43,
    "text": "Is it usually leftovers or something else?",
    "start": 106.423,
    "end": 109.525,
    "zh": "通常是剩菜还是别的？",
    "zh_hant": "通常是剩菜還是別的？"
  },
  {
    "index": 44,
    "text": "It's usually leftovers when I come into work",
    "start": 109.925,
    "end": 113.847,
    "zh": "我上班的时候通常吃剩菜，",
    "zh_hant": "我上班的時候通常吃剩菜，"
  },
  {
    "index": 45,
    "text": "because it's easier,",
    "start": 113.967,
    "end": 116.688,
    "zh": "因为这样更方便，",
    "zh_hant": "因為這樣更方便，"
  },
  {
    "index": 46,
    "text": "and then I don't need to buy lunch.",
    "start": 116.338,
    "end": 118.689,
    "zh": "而且我也不用去买午餐。",
    "zh_hant": "而且我也不用去買午餐。"
  },
  {
    "index": 47,
    "text": "But if I go out and buy food,",
    "start": 119.03,
    "end": 122.111,
    "zh": "但如果我出去买吃的，",
    "zh_hant": "但如果我出去買吃的，"
  },
  {
    "index": 48,
    "text": "then I would usually go for something",
    "start": 122.072,
    "end": 125.493,
    "zh": "我通常会选择",
    "zh_hant": "我通常會選擇"
  },
  {
    "index": 49,
    "text": "like sushi",
    "start": 125.653,
    "end": 127.014,
    "zh": "寿司",
    "zh_hant": "壽司"
  },
  {
    "index": 50,
    "text": "or ramen.",
    "start": 127.074,
    "end": 128.394,
    "zh": "或者拉面。",
    "zh_hant": "或者拉麵。"
  },
  {
    "index": 51,
    "text": "What about you?",
    "start": 128.775,
    "end": 129.855,
    "zh": "你呢？",
    "zh_hant": "你呢？"
  },
  {
    "index": 52,
    "text": "What do you usually have for lunch?",
    "start": 129.505,
    "end": 131.836,
    "zh": "你平时午餐一般吃什么？",
    "zh_hant": "你平時午餐一般吃什麼？"
  },
  {
    "index": 53,
    "text": "Yeah.",
    "start": 133.977,
    "end": 134.638,
    "zh": "嗯。",
    "zh_hant": "嗯。"
  },
  {
    "index": 54,
    "text": "Sometimes I have leftovers that I bring in.",
    "start": 134.288,
    "end": 137.239,
    "zh": "有时候我吃带的剩菜。",
    "zh_hant": "有時候我吃帶的剩菜。"
  },
  {
    "index": 55,
    "text": "Sometimes, I buy a sandwich, for example.",
    "start": 136.899,
    "end": 140.36,
    "zh": "有时候我会买个三明治什么的。",
    "zh_hant": "有時候我會買個三明治什麼的。"
  },
  {
    "index": 56,
    "text": "What's your favourite kind of sandwich?",
    "start": 140.901,
    "end": 143.282,
    "zh": "你最喜欢什么三明治？",
    "zh_hant": "你最喜歡什麼三明治？"
  },
  {
    "index": 57,
    "text": "If I have a sandwich,",
    "start": 144.143,
    "end": 146.023,
    "zh": "如果我吃三明治，",
    "zh_hant": "如果我吃三明治，"
  },
  {
    "index": 58,
    "text": "if I buy a sandwich for lunch,",
    "start": 145.673,
    "end": 148.284,
    "zh": "如果我午餐买三明治，",
    "zh_hant": "如果我午餐買三明治，"
  },
  {
    "index": 59,
    "text": "I like to get things like smoked salmon.",
    "start": 147.964,
    "end": 151.446,
    "zh": "我喜欢买烟熏三文鱼那种。",
    "zh_hant": "我喜歡買菸燻三文魚那種。"
  },
  {
    "index": 60,
    "text": "Nice.",
    "start": 151.946,
    "end": 152.847,
    "zh": "不错。",
    "zh_hant": "不錯。"
  },
  {
    "index": 61,
    "text": "With pickles maybe, yeah.",
    "start": 152.707,
    "end": 155.748,
    "zh": "可能再加点酸黄瓜，嗯。",
    "zh_hant": "可能再加點酸黃瓜，嗯。"
  },
  {
    "index": 62,
    "text": "There's a really good baguette I like actually",
    "start": 156.028,
    "end": 158.63,
    "zh": "其实我很喜欢一种特别好的法棍面包",
    "zh_hant": "其實我很喜歡一種特別好的法棍麵包"
  },
  {
    "index": 63,
    "text": "that has smoked salmon",
    "start": 158.28,
    "end": 161.131,
    "zh": "里面有烟熏三文鱼",
    "zh_hant": "裡面有煙燻三文魚"
  },
  {
    "index": 64,
    "text": "and egg mayonnaise in it.",
    "start": 161.252,
    "end": 164.293,
    "zh": "和鸡蛋蛋黄酱。",
    "zh_hant": "和雞蛋蛋黃醬。"
  },
  {
    "index": 65,
    "text": "Oh, it's so nice.",
    "start": 164.113,
    "end": 165.473,
    "zh": "哦，太好吃了。",
    "zh_hant": "哦，太好吃了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 66,
    "text": "Stop it.",
    "start": 165.374,
    "end": 166.294,
    "zh": "别说了。",
    "zh_hant": "別說了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 67,
    "text": "Sorry.",
    "start": 166.054,
    "end": 166.774,
    "zh": "抱歉。",
    "zh_hant": "抱歉。"
  },
  {
    "index": 68,
    "text": "I'm so hungry.",
    "start": 166.424,
    "end": 167.654,
    "zh": "我太饿了。",
    "zh_hant": "我太餓了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 69,
    "text": "Me too.",
    "start": 167.304,
    "end": 168.095,
    "zh": "我也是。",
    "zh_hant": "我也是。"
  },
  {
    "index": 70,
    "text": "Neil, do you ever skip lunch?",
    "start": 168.695,
    "end": 170.976,
    "zh": "尼尔，你跳过不吃午餐吗？",
    "zh_hant": "尼爾，你跳過不吃午餐嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 71,
    "text": "No way.",
    "start": 171.877,
    "end": 172.977,
    "zh": "绝对不会。",
    "zh_hant": "絕對不會。"
  },
  {
    "index": 72,
    "text": "I would be in a horrible mood if I skipped lunch.",
    "start": 173.297,
    "end": 177.319,
    "zh": "我要是跳过午餐，心情会糟透了。",
    "zh_hant": "我要是跳過午餐，心情會糟透了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 73,
    "text": "I don't understand how anyone can skip any meal.",
    "start": 178.0,
    "end": 182.121,
    "zh": "我真不明白怎么能有人跳过任何一餐。",
    "zh_hant": "我真不明白怎麼能有人跳過任何一餐。"
  },
  {
    "index": 74,
    "text": "I need to eat all my meals.",
    "start": 182.522,
    "end": 185.083,
    "zh": "我每顿饭都得吃。",
    "zh_hant": "我每頓飯都得吃。"
  },
  {
    "index": 75,
    "text": "Yeah.",
    "start": 185.303,
    "end": 185.983,
    "zh": "是啊。",
    "zh_hant": "是啊。"
  },
  {
    "index": 76,
    "text": "Otherwise, you get hangry.",
    "start": 186.124,
    "end": 187.864,
    "zh": "不然你就会变成饿怒。",
    "zh_hant": "不然你就會變成餓怒。"
  },
  {
    "index": 77,
    "text": "Exactly.",
    "start": 187.825,
    "end": 188.785,
    "zh": "没错。",
    "zh_hant": "沒錯。"
  },
  {
    "index": 78,
    "text": "'Hangry' is hungry and angry.",
    "start": 188.485,
    "end": 191.626,
    "zh": "饿怒就是又饿又生气。",
    "zh_hant": "餓怒就是又餓又生氣。"
  },
  {
    "index": 79,
    "text": "I'm on the…",
    "start": 191.927,
    "end": 194.107,
    "zh": "我现在有点……",
    "zh_hant": "我現在有點……"
  },
  {
    "index": 80,
    "text": "I'm almost getting hangry now.",
    "start": 193.757,
    "end": 196.008,
    "zh": "我现在差不多要饿怒了。",
    "zh_hant": "我現在差不多要餓怒了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 81,
    "text": "What's your favourite meal?",
    "start": 196.789,
    "end": 198.69,
    "zh": "你最喜欢哪一餐？",
    "zh_hant": "你最喜歡哪一餐？"
  },
  {
    "index": 82,
    "text": "Is it lunch?",
    "start": 198.43,
    "end": 199.51,
    "zh": "午餐吗？",
    "zh_hant": "午餐嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 83,
    "text": "Breakfast?",
    "start": 199.591,
    "end": 200.591,
    "zh": "早餐？",
    "zh_hant": "早餐？"
  },
  {
    "index": 84,
    "text": "Dinner?",
    "start": 200.241,
    "end": 200.951,
    "zh": "晚餐？",
    "zh_hant": "晚餐？"
  },
  {
    "index": 85,
    "text": "I think the evening meal is probably my favourite",
    "start": 202.992,
    "end": 207.474,
    "zh": "我觉得晚饭大概是我最喜欢的，",
    "zh_hant": "我覺得晚飯大概是我最喜歡的，"
  },
  {
    "index": 86,
    "text": "because we sit at the table and chat and it's the biggest,",
    "start": 207.124,
    "end": 211.396,
    "zh": "因为我们会坐在桌前聊天，而且那是一天中最大、",
    "zh_hant": "因為我們會坐在桌前聊天，而且那是一天中最大、"
  },
  {
    "index": 87,
    "text": "nicest meal of the day and you don't really have to do anything",
    "start": 211.076,
    "end": 215.538,
    "zh": "最好的一餐，而且之后你也不用再做什么",
    "zh_hant": "最好的一餐，而且之後你也不用再做什麼"
  },
  {
    "index": 88,
    "text": "after so you can relax.",
    "start": 215.499,
    "end": 217.659,
    "zh": "所以可以放松一下。",
    "zh_hant": "所以可以放鬆一下。"
  },
  {
    "index": 89,
    "text": "Yeah that's good.",
    "start": 218.26,
    "end": 219.6,
    "zh": "嗯，那挺好的。",
    "zh_hant": "嗯，那挺好的。"
  },
  {
    "index": 90,
    "text": "I really like brunch",
    "start": 219.801,
    "end": 221.401,
    "zh": "我很喜欢早午餐",
    "zh_hant": "我很喜歡早午餐"
  },
  {
    "index": 91,
    "text": "which is that sort of in between breakfast and lunch,",
    "start": 221.221,
    "end": 225.023,
    "zh": "就是那种介于早餐和午餐之间的，",
    "zh_hant": "就是那種介於早餐和午餐之間的，"
  },
  {
    "index": 92,
    "text": "maybe 10:00.",
    "start": 224.673,
    "end": 226.19,
    "zh": "大概十点钟。",
    "zh_hant": "大概十點鐘。"
  },
  {
    "index": 93,
    "text": "And I might have eggs",
    "start": 226.544,
    "end": 229.045,
    "zh": "我可能会吃鸡蛋",
    "zh_hant": "我可能會吃雞蛋"
  },
  {
    "index": 94,
    "text": "and bacon and hash browns and avocado,",
    "start": 228.695,
    "end": 232.467,
    "zh": "培根、薯饼和牛油果，",
    "zh_hant": "培根、薯餅和牛油果，"
  },
  {
    "index": 95,
    "text": "a big meal full of lots of good food,",
    "start": 232.287,
    "end": 235.828,
    "zh": "一顿丰盛的大餐，全是好吃的，",
    "zh_hant": "一頓豐盛的大餐，全是好吃的，"
  },
  {
    "index": 96,
    "text": "like a brunch.",
    "start": 235.788,
    "end": 236.869,
    "zh": "就像早午餐那种。",
    "zh_hant": "就像早午餐那種。"
  },
  {
    "index": 97,
    "text": "Do you ever have a working lunch ?",
    "start": 237.409,
    "end": 240.23,
    "zh": "你有没有吃过工作午餐？",
    "zh_hant": "你有沒有吃過工作午餐？"
  },
  {
    "index": 98,
    "text": "I do occasionally if I'm working from home",
    "start": 241.172,
    "end": 245.094,
    "zh": "我在家工作的时候偶尔会，",
    "zh_hant": "我在家工作的時候偶爾會，"
  },
  {
    "index": 99,
    "text": "because I can carry",
    "start": 246.615,
    "end": 249.837,
    "zh": "因为我可以一边继续",
    "zh_hant": "因為我可以一邊繼續"
  },
  {
    "index": 100,
    "text": "on working and eat quickly.",
    "start": 249.487,
    "end": 251.218,
    "zh": "工作一边快速吃东西。",
    "zh_hant": "工作一邊快速吃東西。"
  },
  {
    "index": 101,
    "text": "And then in my actual lunch break,",
    "start": 250.868,
    "end": 253.159,
    "zh": "然后在真正的午休时间，",
    "zh_hant": "然後在真正的午休時間，"
  },
  {
    "index": 102,
    "text": "I might have a nice long walk",
    "start": 252.809,
    "end": 255.5,
    "zh": "我可能会去好好散个步",
    "zh_hant": "我可能會去好好散個步"
  },
  {
    "index": 103,
    "text": "or something like that, but when I'm in the office,",
    "start": 255.18,
    "end": 258.782,
    "zh": "之类的，但在办公室的时候，",
    "zh_hant": "之類的，但在辦公室的時候，"
  },
  {
    "index": 104,
    "text": "I don't want to eat at my desk.",
    "start": 258.432,
    "end": 260.223,
    "zh": "我不想在办公桌前吃饭。",
    "zh_hant": "我不想在辦公桌前吃飯。"
  },
  {
    "index": 105,
    "text": "No. Me neither.",
    "start": 260.143,
    "end": 261.584,
    "zh": "不，我也是。",
    "zh_hant": "不，我也是。"
  },
  {
    "index": 106,
    "text": "I don't really like working lunches .",
    "start": 261.604,
    "end": 264.49,
    "zh": "我不是很喜欢工作午餐。",
    "zh_hant": "我不是很喜歡工作午餐。"
  },
  {
    "index": 107,
    "text": "I would rather eat my lunch without working.",
    "start": 264.506,
    "end": 267.948,
    "zh": "我宁愿不吃工作餐。",
    "zh_hant": "我寧願不吃工作餐。"
  },
  {
    "index": 108,
    "text": "Yeah, I'd prefer the same, really.",
    "start": 268.848,
    "end": 271.71,
    "zh": "嗯，我也更喜欢这样。",
    "zh_hant": "嗯，我也更喜歡這樣。"
  },
  {
    "index": 109,
    "text": "We heard 'working",
    "start": 279.21,
    "end": 281.01,
    "zh": "我们听到了‘工作",
    "zh_hant": "我們聽到了‘工作"
  },
  {
    "index": 110,
    "text": "lunch',",
    "start": 288.055,
    "end": 289.115,
    "zh": "午餐’这个词，",
    "zh_hant": "午餐’這個詞，"
  },
  {
    "index": 111,
    "text": "which is when you eat your lunch",
    "start": 289.455,
    "end": 293.537,
    "zh": "就是指一边吃饭",
    "zh_hant": "就是指一邊吃飯"
  },
  {
    "index": 112,
    "text": "while you're working.",
    "start": 293.317,
    "end": 294.638,
    "zh": "一边工作。",
    "zh_hant": "一邊工作。"
  },
  {
    "index": 113,
    "text": "We also had 'leftovers', which is when you don't finish a meal,",
    "start": 295.418,
    "end": 299.78,
    "zh": "我们还学了‘剩菜’，就是一餐没吃完，",
    "zh_hant": "我們還學了‘剩菜’，就是一餐沒吃完，"
  },
  {
    "index": 114,
    "text": "so you have more of it at a different time, like the next day.",
    "start": 299.56,
    "end": 303.342,
    "zh": "然后在别的时间再吃，比如第二天。",
    "zh_hant": "然後在別的時間再吃，比如第二天。"
  },
  {
    "index": 115,
    "text": "And we talked about which meals and food we prefer.",
    "start": 303.682,
    "end": 307.444,
    "zh": "我们还聊到了我们更喜欢哪些餐和食物。",
    "zh_hant": "我們還聊到了我們更喜歡哪些餐和食物。"
  },
  {
    "index": 116,
    "text": "If you prefer something, you like it better than something else.",
    "start": 307.284,
    "end": 311.166,
    "zh": "如果你更喜欢某样东西，意思就是你比别的东西更喜欢它。",
    "zh_hant": "如果你更喜歡某樣東西，意思就是你比別的東西更喜歡它。"
  },
  {
    "index": 117,
    "text": "Yes.",
    "start": 311.186,
    "end": 311.966,
    "zh": "对。",
    "zh_hant": "對。"
  },
  {
    "index": 118,
    "text": "And another phrase we can use to say this is 'would rather'.",
    "start": 311.686,
    "end": 316.028,
    "zh": "我们还可以用另一个短语来表达这个意思，就是‘宁愿’。",
    "zh_hant": "我們還可以用另一個短語來表達這個意思，就是‘寧願’。"
  },
  {
    "index": 119,
    "text": "For example, I 'd rather have sushi",
    "start": 315.908,
    "end": 318.87,
    "zh": "比如，午餐我宁愿吃寿司",
    "zh_hant": "比如，午餐我寧願吃壽司"
  },
  {
    "index": 120,
    "text": "than a sandwich for lunch.",
    "start": 318.65,
    "end": 320.452,
    "zh": "也不吃三明治。",
    "zh_hant": "也不吃三明治。"
  },
  {
    "index": 121,
    "text": "That's it for this episode of Real Easy English.",
    "start": 320.673,
    "end": 323.675,
    "zh": "以上就是本期《简易英语》的全部内容。",
    "zh_hant": "以上就是本期《簡易英語》的全部內容。"
  },
  {
    "index": 122,
    "text": "Test what you've learned with a worksheet on our website,",
    "start": 323.325,
    "end": 326.378,
    "zh": "用我们网站上的工作表来测试你学到的内容，",
    "zh_hant": "用我們網站上的工作表來測試你學到的內容，"
  },
  {
    "index": 123,
    "text": "bbclearningenglish.com.",
    "start": 326.079,
    "end": 328.32,
    "zh": "bbclearningenglish.com。",
    "zh_hant": "bbclearningenglish.com。"
  },
  {
    "index": 124,
    "text": "And make sure you join us again",
    "start": 328.381,
    "end": 330.823,
    "zh": "记得一定要再来听我们",
    "zh_hant": "記得一定要再來聽我們"
  },
  {
    "index": 125,
    "text": "for another easy English conversation.",
    "start": 330.543,
    "end": 333.666,
    "zh": "下一期的简易英语对话。",
    "zh_hant": "下一期的簡易英語對話。"
  },
  {
    "index": 126,
    "text": "We'll be back next week.",
    "start": 333.567,
    "end": 335.148,
    "zh": "我们下周见。",
    "zh_hant": "我們下週見。"
  },
  {
    "index": 127,
    "text": "See you soon.",
    "start": 334.948,
    "end": 335.929,
    "zh": "再见。",
    "zh_hant": "再見。"
  },
  {
    "index": 128,
    "text": "Goodbye.",
    "start": 335.579,
    "end": 336.89,
    "zh": "拜拜。",
    "zh_hant": "拜拜。"
  }
]
